# Harnav — Development Journal

**Project:** NurseSync  
**Contribution area:** Patient workflow, task management, and shift handoff

## Week 1 — Patient selection and dashboard flow

Built the patient-selection and dashboard workflow so nursing staff can enter the application, select the relevant patient, and reach the most important actions with minimal navigation.

## Week 2 — Patient timeline and clinical logs

Implemented the patient timeline experience and connected it to the patient and log APIs. The timeline presents entries in clinical order so staff can quickly understand recent events.

## Week 3 — Task prioritisation

Developed the task-management view to organise nursing work into a clear, actionable list. The UI supports a focused shift workflow rather than treating tasks as unstructured notes.

## Week 4 — Shift handoff

Implemented the handoff interface and its backend route integration. The handoff flow preserves structured patient context so the incoming staff member can continue care with the relevant information available.

## Week 5 — Workflow integration

Connected patient selection, timeline, tasks, and handoff screens through the shared router and application state. Reviewed the end-to-end nursing workflow from patient selection to handoff.

